    "totalDuration": "5 yrs 9 mos",
    "description": "I develop and very occasionally maintain custom software solutions for a diverse client base, delivering high-quality products on time and within budget.\n\nA noteworthy client experience: teaching programming to a small business owner, basically coding over his shoulder as he wanted to understand the entirety of the platform he was buying. \nWe built a node.js and express served cool little storefront supporting online orders from his convenience store.  He took notes and we built the application side by side. Typically in whatever freetime he found, he would ring me up.  Despite the slight language barrier, it was rewarding watching his understanding grow as we proceeded, at first just asking questions about what I had produced, then typing at my direction, but by the time we were done I could go make coffee and he would have the bug found and have the next little module laid out, just having a blast coding. I graduated him when the site was pretty well set and he didn't really need me anymore, and stopped taking his money.  I'm not sure what he's moved on to but he took  the site down a few months ago.",
